{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Step into a twisted 80s-inspired world full of dark secrets, haunted graveyards, and\u00a0 \u00a0supernatural threats. Travel trough the board and explore the different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/birdseye_v8_no_fog__1_.gif?t=1749027017\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/BGS_Header_1_614x60.png?t=1749027017\" />\u00a0Battle your way through the board. The tougher the foe, the better the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/BGS_Header_2_614x60.png?t=1749027017\" />\u00a0Trick, trap, or take them down... but beware, they\u2019ll do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/BGS_Header_3_614x60.png?t=1749027017\" />\u00a0Hunt down hidden crystals across the board. No crystals, no final fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/extras/BGS_Header_4_614x60.png?t=1749027017\" />\u00a0Only one can claim victory. Will you have the most crystals? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer PVP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiplayer PVE</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Boardgame aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Crossplay (IOS/Android/PC)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Horror satirical elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Custom cards and boardgame </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Skin customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Tabletop vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dynamic optimization of game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> P2P hosting solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In-game tutorial</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3037040?t=1749027017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749027017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/6d1f9d279eb9cd3235effaf5f530ed48ffd6ba23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749027017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037040/6d1f9d279eb9cd3235effaf5f530ed48ffd6ba23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749027017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Step into a twisted 80s-inspired world full of dark secrets, haunted graveyards, and\u00a0 \u00a0supernatural threats. Travel trough the board and explore the different areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\